# Build context for apps/api/Dockerfile is the repository root (the image needs
# packages/contracts). Everything the API image does not need stays out so the
# context is small and no secret can be COPYed in by accident.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.expo
.git
.github
.idea
.claude
.specify
apps/mobile
docs
specs
infra
**/*.md
!apps/api/README.md
.env
.env.*
*.stackdump
